@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
### List seed rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms
### Create a booking with one of the room IDs above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "requesterName": "Alex Murphy",
  "requesterEmail": "alex@example.ie",
  "startsAt": "2027-02-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-02-10T11:00:00Z"
}
### List bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings?page=0&size=20
